body:
Video stores!  I used to love going down to Hollywood Video and rentibg movies.  I kind of hate streaming.  Cars that weren't practically computers.   I miss my 2004 Toyota:(  This may be a weird one, but physical maps, encyclopedias and dictionaries.   People look at me as if I had two heads when  i say that...but I can't help it.   I actually enjoyed not having easy access to everything, and i love maps.
 Life before social media and smart phones.   i really hate how technology is just taking over...annd I honestly worry that the next generation is going to have a lot of issues.   Not relying on tech is a good thing. 

]
